  "body": "MACLEANS COLLEGE | BUCKLANDS BEACH INTERMEDIATE | BUCKLANDS BEACH PRIMARY SCHOOL ZONES\r\n\r\nContemporary comfort with a private place to unwind.\r\n\r\nA brand-new home offers the pleasure of moving into a fresh, modern environment, and 45D Hattaway Avenue brings that appeal to an established Bucklands Beach address.\r\n\r\nThe open-plan kitchen, living and dining area connects to a private, fenced outdoor space, providing an easy transition between indoors and out.\r\n\r\nWith three bedrooms, 2.5 bathrooms and an internal-access garage, the home offers a practical arrangement for everyday living.\r\n\r\nThe upstairs master bedroom includes an ensuite and walk-in wardrobe, while two additional bedrooms share a family bathroom.\r\n\r\nFeatures to appreciate:\r\n• Title and CCC issued\r\n• Three bedrooms and 2.5 bathrooms\r\n•  Contemporary kitchen and open-plan living\r\n•  Indoor-outdoor connection\r\n•  Master ensuite and walk-in wardrobe\r\n•  Internal-access single garage\r\n•  Private, fenced outdoor area\r\n•  Brand-new, easy-care design\r\n\r\nWith shops, cafés, waterfront destinations and local amenities nearby, you can enjoy the convenience of an established East Auckland neighbourhood.\r\n\r\nA fresh home, a private outdoor space and everyday convenience.",
